---
description: Make pages requested for immediate evaluation directly accessible from navigation
alwaysApply: true
---

# Add evaluation pages to navigation

When the user explicitly asks for a page to be developed for immediate evaluation, add a visible link to that page in the appropriate app navigation as part of the same change.

Treat the navigation entry as temporary unless the user says it should be permanent. Keep it easy to identify and remove after evaluation.

Do not add unrelated pages to navigation, and do not expose a page when doing so would bypass its existing authentication or permission requirements.
